  "caption": "**Figure 1. Replacement in a constructed geometric DEMO, with flow stopped.** (a) The conventional sequence first detaches the housing and its two interfaces from the pipe. (b) Successive seated and withdrawn states of the same candidate: the frame and two different filter layers (1, 2) form one cartridge; the housing, interfaces and sealing ring remain fixed. Matching outlines and layer IDs show that withdrawal preserves the layer order. Arrows denote removal motion only. The cutaway geometry and seal outline are schematic and not to scale. These position relationships do not establish filtration, sealing or manufacturing performance.",
